Erf. 1727.</hi>                         </p>                         <lb/>
<p>                           <hi rendition="#et">I. <hi rendition="#g">Rud. Engau</hi> pr. <hi rendition="#i">de blasphemia illiusque poena.</hi> Ien.<lb/>
