<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>                   <div n="7">                     <head><hi rendition="#g">Er&#x017F;te Unterabtheilung</hi>.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#i">Von den Gründen der Vermuthung oder von Indicien.</hi></head>                     <lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>                     <p>                       <hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#g">Thomae Nani Valtellinen&#x017F;is</hi> <hi rendition="#i">de indiciis,<lb/>
eorumque u&#x017F;u in cognoscendis criminibus liber &#x017F;ingula<supplied>ris</supplied></hi>.<lb/>
